%% CrestFlow - State Machine: Execution Saga (report level)
%% Type: UML state machine
%% Rule: happy path, policy block, failure and compensation.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PLANNING
  PLANNING --> SIMULATING : built
  SIMULATING --> POLICY_CHECK : passed
  POLICY_CHECK --> BLOCKED : any check fails
  POLICY_CHECK --> SIGNING : approved
  SIGNING --> BROADCASTING : signed
  BROADCASTING --> CONFIRMING : broadcast
  CONFIRMING --> COMPLETED : finality reached

  PLANNING --> FAILED : reject or timeout
  SIMULATING --> FAILED : revert or timeout
  BROADCASTING --> FAILED : reject or timeout
  CONFIRMING --> FAILED : confirmation timeout

  FAILED --> COMPENSATED : rollback or manual recovery
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  BLOCKED --> [*]
  COMPENSATED --> [*]

  note right of POLICY_CHECK : Nine checks, no short-circuit
  note right of SIGNING : TEE for AUTOPILOT, user wallet for MANUAL
  note right of CONFIRMING : CCTP is burn, attest, then mint
